  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CAAFAG - barnsoldater, phase 2</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAAFAG - child soldiers, phase 2 - CAAFAG</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">By end-2018, prevention and protection against all forms of violence, child abuse, and exploitation, as well as access to civil registry services and legal protection will have been significantly and equitably strengthened. The component of Governance for child protection will help protect children&#x2019;s rights by reinforcing the safety networks for vulnerable children (victims of violence, exploitation, child abuse, neglect, stigmatization), by ensuring access to services for child victims of, or affected by, armed conflicts, and by promoting positive social standards. It will support capacity building for planning, following up on and coordinating interventions, including surveillance, monitoring, and up on and coordinating interventions, including surveillance, monitoring, and reporting of all forms of violence, child abuse and exploitation.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Continued support to reintegration into society of ex child soldiers.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Fortsatt st&#xf6;d till &#xe5;terintegrering i samh&#xe4;llet av barn associerade med v&#xe4;pnade grupper som implementeras av UNICEF sedan 2013. Insatsperioden har f&#xf6;rl&#xe4;ngts f&#xf6;r att t&#xe4;cka &#xe4;ven 2018 i syfte att harmonisera UNICEFs arbete med skydd av barn till deras nya landprogram med start 2019. Insatsen fokuserar b&#xe5;de p&#xe5; kortsiktigt st&#xf6;d till barn associerade med v&#xe4;pnade grupper via vistelse i transitcenter eller i fosterfamiljer, samt att skapa grunden f&#xf6;r mer l&#xe5;ngsiktigt ekonomisk integrering in i mottagande samh&#xe4;llen. Det senare sker genom att st&#xf6;dja skolg&#xe5;ng samt grunden f&#xf6;r yrkesutbildning.</narrative>
  </description>
